<title>DENMARK: Unibank issues 200 mln DKK FRN, due 1999.</title>
<headline>Unibank issues 200 mln DKK FRN, due 1999.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Unibank said on Friday that it was issuing the following Floating Rate Note on the Euromarket.</p>
<p>    ISSUER: UNIBANK   AMOUNT: 200 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>    MATURITY: DECEMBER 15 1999   COUPON: FIRST QUARTER,</p>
<p>TWO-MONTH CIBOR + 0.45 PERCENT. THEREAFTER THREE-MONTH CIBOR + 0.45 PERCENT. CAPPED AT 4.45 PERCENT IN FIRST QUARTER AND 5.45 PERCENT THEREAFTER.   ISS DATE: APRIL 18 1997. ISS PRICE: AS</p>
<p>MARKET ON ISS DATE. INTEREST PAID: QUARTERLY.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
